# Inverted chat under abuse: history loads and incoming rows during flings both ways,
# bursts while dragging slowly, and a return to the bottom.
route Chat
latency 0,0
wait 3
mark incoming-burst-at-bottom
repeat 3 press 262 78
wait 2.5
mark fling-up-into-history
repeat 6 pan 200 200 0 600 100
wait 2
mark history-mid-fling-x2
pan 200 200 0 600 90
press 210 78
wait 0.3
press 210 78
wait 3
mark incoming-mid-fling-up
pan 200 200 0 600 90
press 262 78
wait 3
mark slow-drag-with-history
press 210 78
pan 200 300 0 400 1500
wait 2.5
mark fling-down-with-incoming
pan 200 750 0 -650 90
press 262 78
wait 3
mark fling-to-bottom
repeat 10 pan 200 750 0 -700 100
wait 2.5
mark incoming-at-bottom-after-flings
press 262 78
wait 2
mark history-at-bottom
press 210 78
wait 2.5
mark stt-from-bottom
statusbar
wait 3
mark random-then-incoming
press 317 78
wait 1.5
press 262 78
wait 2.5
